_:n765bf888a8464696939b2fb301c65306b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A shortcut on an Expression Map: its value must be a\n        boolean-returning function-valued expression map. If the\n        condition evaluates to true, the enclosing Expression Map's own\n        value is used.\n        " .
