_:nc6c057e108c14033a955e46342183bfcb6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/parent> .
_:n7b61b873c6aa49b9bc5ba6277aa7930eb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is\n            allowed.\n        " .
_:ncb80de0bfd1c476f916c67bc11060689b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:n660ded9839d840fbab144f4c698843a1b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n660ded9839d840fbab144f4c698843a1b9 .
